64
00:08:31.470 --> 00:08:34.270
ikkagi eksport on meil põhiline.

65
00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:40.170
Ma tulin siia saarele ikkagi
tegelikult suvitama,

66
00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:43.750
